      {
        "heading": "Follow the message. Compare the bill.",
        "text": [
          "A managed event bus keeps the path short. A queue and relay trade an extra component and a fixed monthly cost for a lower usage rate. Follow either route, then step up to 10M and 100M messages. All prices are illustrative."
