              "period": "per month",
              "assumptions": "Illustrative USD rates, not vendor quotes. One-way 1 KB messages; one consumer; no retries, batching or free tier. Queue rate includes send, receive and delete; bus rate includes publish and delivery. Fixed relay infrastructure is USD 12/month. Egress, storage, taxes and engineering labor are excluded. Producer infrastructure is shared and excluded equally.",
              "routes": [
                {
                  "id": "bus",
                  "label": "Managed event bus",
                  "tradeoff": "Managed routing and delivery. Three engineering nodes; less infrastructure to operate."
                },
                {
                  "id": "queue",
                  "label": "Queue + relay",
                  "tradeoff": "Four engineering nodes. Own the relay, retries, dead-letter handling and monitoring; labor is not priced here."
                }
